// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Amanda Loomis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1746154149" "Amanda Loomis"
// ProfessionString :
"P2753663441" "INS Investigator"
// DescriptionString :
"P1908602728" "Amanda Loomis works for the Immigration and Naturalization Service as a special investigator. She specializes in criminal investigations that involve immigrants in some way, either as perpetrators or as victims. In the xenophobic culture that has developed since the Rikti War, anti-immigrant feelings are running high in America, but Amanda is trying to change that. Amanda has recently begun looking to heroes to make her job easier, especially when she's investigating criminal groups that include a large number of immigrants, like the Tsoo. In this job, she needs all the help she can get."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2795972436" "I don't talk to villains, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P3713020373" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Things are heating up.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P4227829610" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Our melting pot is turning into a powder keg.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1944388301" "I have other things to do. Why don't you go talk to {LastContactName}?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P4099212074" "I can really use a hand keeping the lid on this pressure cooker."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1781571808" "My cases are cut and dry lately. Maybe one of your other contacts has something hairy."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2816225958" "That's a lot of work for one hero. You should complete some of it before looking for more."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2480704450" "My next case involves some sticky technicalities. I'd like you to have it after you get to Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3549625432" "You seem like a friend indeed. If you need some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A>, I would be happy to help you out. Please call if there is anything I can do."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1914112607" "A dog may be man's best buddy, but you have become mine, {HeroName}. The <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest Enhancements</A> in my store have your name written all over them."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1496648756" "Time for you to choose the road not taken, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
"P224065995" "Independence Port"
// IntroString :
"P164904999" "The INS has a woman named Amanda Loomis who works well with heroes. She is trying to keep the Tsoo situation from turning any uglier than it already has, and she also has a deep interest in the Warriors. Amanda should be able to get you Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2258570455" "Choose Amanda Loomis"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1000902747" "Amanda likes to use metaphors, but she understands the realities of Paragon City all too well."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P842230060" "One <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> in the hand is worth two in the bush."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2699366411" "Two heads are better than one when it comes to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>information sources.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


