// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Andrea_Mitchell 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Andrea Mitchell 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2813084240" "Andrea Mitchell"
// ProfessionString :
"P3015986474" "Private Security Consultant"
// DescriptionString :
"P1285473017" "Andrea Mitchell is a private security consultant who specializes in protecting clients from paranormal threats. After years spent in the army, Andrea is no stranger to danger, but it's only recently that she became interested in the occult. Two years ago she fell victim to a life-threatening curse while protecting a local businessman who had run afoul of a death cult. She barely survived, but, rather than run from the world of magic like most people would, she vowed to learn more about it. She's been studying hard ever since and knows quite a bit about the supernatural. She also has a wide network of contacts who she turns to for information and assistance, including a number of notable heroes."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P737303040" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I think I have a job you'll be interested in.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1353896956" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There's some stuff I can use your help with.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2875918888" "Sorry, pal, nothing to see here. I think {LastContactName} is looking for you, though."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1219046519" "I can really use your help. I'm up to my ears in paranormal protection gigs!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3411716757" "Security's tight around here. You should go help someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2040310293" "If you take on too many jobs, {HeroName}, you won't be able to give them your all."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3856816811" "All right, I've got something big. But I need you to get to Security Level {Level} before we talk."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3493841156" "We have made a lot of progress together. This is a solid friendship. I'd like you to look over the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> in my store; some of them might work wonders for you. Take my phone number, too."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1531296837" "I couldn't ask for a better partner. You can get my back anytime. And let me get yours. Take a look at <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>my store</A> and tell me what you need."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3485799101" "Even the best partnerships have to end sometime. Thanks for everything, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
"P3637129972" "Talos Island"
// IntroString :
"P22950203" "If you are looking for a partner to help you take down the Banished Pantheon, Andrea Mitchell would be a great choice. She is very dedicated and her connections are top notch. She also has a lot of interest in the Circle of Thorns. Andrea has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P103386175" "Choose Andrea Mitchell"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1656360732" "I have a good feeling about you and Andrea."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1925194788" "Hey, {HeroName}, there's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> I want you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P512804180" "I have told some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> about you, partner."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


