// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Andrew_Fiore 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Andrew Fiore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2420612357" "Andrew Fiore"
// ProfessionString :
"P3481904562" "Electronics Purveyor"
// DescriptionString :
"P3301643654" "With their experimental armor and high tech weapons, heroes are always in need of some special electronic part that's impossible to find. Andrew Fiore makes it his job to find those parts. He deals with all manner of sources, some of them a little less than honest. As a result, he hears a great many interesting things, and he's more than happy to pass on tips to his hero clients. He's proud to do his part to put criminals behind bars, and he'll occasionally give out more than just information if he thinks a greased palm may get the job done. He's especially fervent when it comes to villains that directly impact his business, such as the thieving Freakshow."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3344651412" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got the goods for you.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1989239112" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I heard some interesting things today.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2680002885" "Sorry, I'm all out. Maybe next week we'll get that in. If you can't wait, go see {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1854399822" "Don't worry, I will keep you in the know about all the most recent Freakshow activities."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P109949838" "I'll get you any parts you need, but I can't get you any more jobs. Better ask someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4095571596" "Keep working at this pace, {HeroName}, and you're going to burn out. I can't give you another task."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1841047667" "I'd like to give you a mission, but it's classified. Maybe when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3979911917" "You just got upgraded to VIP customer status, my friend. That means some of the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>back shelves</A> just opened up for you. I'm always available to you, {HeroName}, so call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1516926318" "Congratulations, you're my number one customer! Let me show you where I keep my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>one-of-a-kind parts!</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3787812249" "It's time for you to look for your bargains elsewhere, hero."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3694739424" "I think you should meet Andrew Fiore. Not only can he sell you quality electronics, but he's got information about lots of less savory business deals. He's helped more than a few heroes, especially with information about the Freakshow and the Family. Andrew has a lot of sources that give him access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1547197450" "Choose Andrew Fiore"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3515206295" "Andrew is a businessman first, but it's in his best interest to keep the heroes he works with up to date on information."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2269413240" "I've got a great <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> for you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P194460616" "I always like to give my heroes a choice when they are looking for a new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


