// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Barry_Gosford 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Barry Gosford 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1555701210" "Barry Gosford"
// ProfessionString :
"P3256300167" "Police Lieutenant"
// DescriptionString :
"P88678636" "Lt. Barry Gosford works for the Paragon City Police Department, running a detail that specializes in emerging threats. These are criminal organizations or social trends that the officers feel have the potential to become highly dangerous unless checked at an early stage. Identifying and fighting such groups is a daunting task, but the detail has had one notable success: the total elimination of the Dragon Aces, a super-powered gang that was growing in strength until about a year ago, when Lt. Gosford's special unit was first founded. While Gosford and his men do take credit for bringing down the Dragon Aces, they also admit that they had a little help from another rising threat: the Tsoo. These days the Sky Raiders are a major concern for Gosford and his group, although they've recently opened a major investigation into the Council as well."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2652163846" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got an investigation in need of help.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2591865867" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got some good leads that I can use your help on.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2611126638" "I've got nothing for you at the moment. But you should check with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1930341042" "The Sky Raiders are getting ready to make some kind of move; I can feel it. I hope you can help me stop them."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3262692499" "I've got this beat covered, {HeroName}. You should help out somebody else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P76758352" "You look awfully busy, {HeroName}. The force will just have to make do until you clear out some of those cases."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3572923056" "I'd like to give you a job, but you'll have to reach Security Level {Level} first."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2436528665" "Friend, I think you might be able to work with us for awhile. The police department likes to keep its <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest equipment</A> under wraps, but I think I can get you a sneak peek. Call in frequently."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2202560511" "The kind of trust you are inspiring is what helped us bring down the Dragon Aces. I'm beginning to worry about your safety, {HeroName}. I want you to outfit yourself with some of my very <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>best Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1722355049" "Thanks for your help, but, as much as I hate to admit it, there are bigger threats than the Sky Raiders facing this city."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P148972083" "I've been asked to introduce you to Lt. Gosford from the Paragon City Police Department. He runs a special unit that is focused on bringing down the Sky Raiders and the Council. Gosford's connections within the department give him access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3801805123" "Choose Lt. Gosford"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2174750066" "Gosford is used to working with heroes. You will get along fine."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3705483383" "I've got a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> for you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1484605721" "A couple of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> want to meet with you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


