// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Cain Royce 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3340783038" "Cain Royce"
// ProfessionString :
"P3961506401" "Philanthropist"
// DescriptionString :
"P1707857665" "Cain Royce is the head of the Royce Foundation, which was started by his grandfather at the turn of the 20th Century. The foundation was originally a religious organization whose goal was to support African American churches through the financial and discriminatory challenges they suffered. However, Grandfather Royce soon faced a challenge he'd never anticipated. A foul cult of demon worshipers was preying on Paragon City's African American community. He turned all his resources to fighting this cult and, with the help of the whole community, succeeded. Ever since, the Royce Foundation has concentrated its resources on fighting malicious occult groups. Cain still works with the community, but he also coordinates the efforts of heroes in the fight against threats like the Banished Pantheon and the Circle of Thorns."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1616503341" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You want to do some good?</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3787062247" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I hope you can help me with a problem.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P848786245" "I am sorry, but you and I have no business together. I think you should get in touch with {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4062761184" "I look forward to your assistance in combating Paragon City's criminal cultists."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2611896591" "Things are going well here, thanks to you. But I'm sure you're needed elsewhere."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3890335036" "You've got your work cut out for you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3129019967" "Tell you what. Get to Security Level {Level}, and I'll look around for a job that's worthy of your talents."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3557873439" "I'm glad we see eye to eye, my friend. Some donors recently gave me some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>interesting Enhancements.</A> Call me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2548422390" "We are truly united in our efforts to combat these foul cultists! You have gained my full confidence. Please look at my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements.</A> I would love to provide you with all the help you can use."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3537653957" "Your cause is just, {HeroName}, but it has moved beyond me."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3738859270" "Cain Royce is strongly committed to his crusade against the Banished Pantheon and the Circle of Thorns. You would do well to have him as an ally. Cain can get you Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P834921907" "Choose Cain Royce"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1520970099" "Paragon City's evil-doers will soon feel the weight of this choice."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3808950543" "There is an <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>associate</A> of mine who I would like you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3277390904" "I believe there are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>others</A> who could benefit from your passion, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


