// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Claire Childress 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2035451211" "Claire Childress"
// ProfessionString :
"P3724650403" "Medium"
// DescriptionString :
"P328869532" "Claire Childress is known in occult circles as an unwilling medium. A natural magnet for ghosts of all kind, Claire's been hearing voices from the spirit world since childhood. She's even been possessed on more than a few occasions. Much of Claire's adolescence was spent in hospital wards for the mentally ill, and not even her parents believed she was sane until she started predicting future disasters. Young Claire found a friend in a hero named Alyssa Stone, a powerful magician. Alyssa became a mother figure to Claire and helped her master her talents and use them for the greater good. Alyssa died in the Rikti War, but Claire continues to work in honor of her memory, helping heroes when she can and warning them of any disturbances she can sense."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1765722727" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We must now attend to our work.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1055558518" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is much to do, as always.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3011997571" "It is not yet our time. I believe you should seek {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2810335128" "Oh, my, it's nice of you to come by. Of course, I've been expecting you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4143885203" "I believe one of your other contacts can guide you better than I."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P245377699" "You have far too many things to do, {HeroName}. I cannot add to your troubles."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3151212373" "See me after you reach Security Level {Level}. Something tells me I'll have a task for you then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3755164298" "My friend, you are as skilled as I expected. I've heard of a few <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>charms</A> that might help you in your adventures. And please, if you need my help, call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2531352101" "I feel we have grown close in our work against the forces of darkness. I hope you will arm yourself with all the most <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>powerful Enhancements</A> in my store."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1876737154" "You must go elsewhere, for it is your time."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P27878365" "Claire Childress is as much a part of the spirit world as our own. Some say she's flighty, but there are few in Paragon City who can provide more aid to one who seeks to battle the Freakshow or the Family. Claire has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1182073171" "Choose Claire Childress"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2779228137" "Listen closely to her words; they may contain more information than you realize."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1669716545" "You need to meet <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> I know."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1795222319" "I believe it is time for you to meet these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


