// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dr_Cheng 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Cheng 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2488914387" "Dr. Cheng"
// ProfessionString :
"P1360647689" "Mystic"
// DescriptionString :
"P173082102" "No one knows Dr. Cheng's first name, or even his real name. Like all wise mystics, he knows that names have power, and so he is careful to hide his. There has been a Dr. Cheng living in Paragon City since the 1840's, and, as far as anyone can tell, this is the same man. He neither confirms nor denies his reputed age. Dr. Cheng wiles away the hours of the day in local restaurants and teahouses, dispensing wisdom, advice, and aid to any who ask it of him. He is known to be a powerful magician who specializes in dealing with malevolent spirits, ghosts, and demons. Since the Rikti War, Dr. Cheng has become closely involved with the city's heroes, offering them help in their ceaseless pursuit of justice. He is particularly interested in the Banished Pantheon and the Circle of Thorns."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3575204310" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Greetings. I hope you are ready for that which lies ahead.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3707278240" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You will face many challenges and learn much.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3915247166" "I am very sorry, but I have no time to spare just now. You should seek {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2767352298" "I can sense great potential within you, {HeroName}. Do not falter from the path you have chosen, difficult though it may be."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P722282300" "Your other contacts can challenge you more greatly than I."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2522071063" "Do not be foolish, {HeroName}. You already have much to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4186153293" "I am concerned for you, my friend. I would like you to attain Security Level {Level} before we talk about your next task."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1207703892" "I was correct about you, {HeroName}. We should not let this friendship die. There are a few <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>powerful charms</A> I've been meaning to show you. They should aid you in your adventures. Please call on me if you are in need."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1340631379" "There is a great strength within you. But I believe you can still benefit from some of my most <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>potent elixirs.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2272120710" "You must seek your future elsewhere."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P571231044" "There's a wise old man named Dr. Cheng who knows just about everything there is to know about the Banished Pantheon and the Circle of Thorns. He has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2098009538" "Choose Dr. Cheng"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P530269885" "Dr. Cheng is very wise, {HeroName}. Pay close attention to his words."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3630354500" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>one</A> you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P58187178" "I must introduce you to some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>others.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


