// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Georgia_Fields 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Georgia Fields 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3256329122" "Georgia Fields"
// ProfessionString :
"P4125265700" "Shadow Walker"
// DescriptionString :
"P4205754803" "Georgia Fields walks in the shadows. She has power over darkness itself, which allows her to fade into shadow and move through the city unseen. Georgia is no hero, though she sometimes works with them. Her true motives remain a mystery, but the heroes who have worked with her over the years have pieced a few things together. Georgia, despite her ever youthful appearance, has been in the city for close to 70 years. She seems to know everyone who is anyone in Paragon City, although many don't seem to know her. She can, if she wishes, make you forget you ever spoke with her. It is rumored that she has stolen a variety of rare and powerful magic artifacts over the decades. Despite all the mystery surrounding her, Georgia has repeatedly proven herself to be a valuable contact. Until proven otherwise, it is assumed that she is a friend."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2632978452" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I hope you are prepared for the things you must face.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P262626055" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Time to walk in the shadows. Just be careful they don't swallow you.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3846750940" "Maybe {LastContactName} will be willing to assist you. I haven't the time."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2177281685" "I'm ready for you. We have much to discuss."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2901687568" "We can help each other no longer, {HeroName}. You should ask one of your other contacts for a job."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4090090630" "That workload could swallow you alive if you're not careful."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1856071372" "My next case is rather dangerous. I'd really feel better if you reached Security Level {Level} first."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1413401552" "You are as good as advertised, my friend. I'm impressed, and that doesn't happen easily. Perhaps I can trust you with some of my more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>potent Enhancements.</A> Don't hesitate to call on me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3401887990" "I don't give my trust easily, but you've earned it. I want you to be prepared for anything the shadow world can throw at you. Please take a look at the most <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>powerful talismans</A> in my store."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1176459015" "I can help you no further. Never forget where you stand in the battle between light and darkness."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4277615201" "I have to admit that Georgia Fields doesn't have the best reputation. No one really knows how she gets her information, but she's an excellent source on the Sky Raiders and the Lost. She is usually able to get her hands on Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P143091999" "Choose Georgia Fields"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2074934527" "If you are careful, Georgia can be of great assistance to you."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1661959208" "I will introduce you to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> now."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3756360149" "Meet these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A>; they could prove useful."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


