// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Hinckley_Rasmussen 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Hinckley Rasmussen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P989548293" "Hinckley Rasmussen"
// ProfessionString :
"P1593854430" "Researcher for Midnight Squad"
// DescriptionString :
"P1676966633" "The Midnight Squad is but a shadow of its former self, having lost many of its most powerful heroes during the war. Now its members concern themselves mainly with research, the preservation of knowledge, and advising more active heroes. Hinckley Rasmussen is a primary example of this new trend. A longtime researcher for the Midnight Squad, he has only recently begun speaking to heroes outside the secretive mystic organization. Now he's come to enjoy helping others quite a bit. He's a charming, somewhat eccentric fellow who gives advice even when it's not asked for. These days his research focuses mostly on the activities of the Tsoo, although he also has an abiding interest in the Warriors."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3714672845" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>My research has revealed some interesting problems.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P4164296172" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There are a number of issues that require your attention.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P722159521" "Sorry, I'm quite busy just now. I believe {LastContactName} has need of you, though."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2365440221" "There is every indication that the Tsoo are gathering their forces. Your timing is most fortuitous."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1920886979" "My research hasn't turned up anything interesting. Why not check with your other contacts?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3432923078" "You've bitten off a little more than you can chew, {HeroName}. I can't give you another case."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3810987525" "You need to get yourself to Security Level {Level} if you're going to take on my next case."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3346916419" "I hope you know that I consider you a friend, {HeroName}. You've sure earned it. You've earned a look at some of my more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>secret Enhancements</A>, too. You can call on me anytime you need help."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1076058025" "It's been a long time since I trusted anyone outside the Midnight Squad this much. {HeroName}, I want you to know our greatest <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>mystical secrets.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3838998203" "It's been great working with you, but you need to move on to greater mysteries."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2187161120" "I know a rather interesting fellow named Hinckley Rasmussen. He works as a researcher for the Midnight Squad and takes an interest in helping heroes like you fight the Tsoo and the Warriors. Hinckley has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2880224816" "Choose Hinckley Rasmussen"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P994424559" "He is a bit eccentric, but Hinckley knows his stuff."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3934379406" "I wish to make you a formal introduction to one of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>colleagues.</A>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3006368114" "Several <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>individuals</A> I know would benefit from your acquaintance."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


