// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Jim_Bell 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jim Bell 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1152887647" "Jim Bell"
// ProfessionString :
"P2558379567" "Reporter"
// DescriptionString :
"P2064993419" "Jim Bell is a veteran journalist who found that retirement just didn't suit him. Instead of staying home, Jim struck out on his own to report on the stories that interest him most. Paragon City soon became his favorite subject, and he developed an intense interest in the various gangs that fight for control of its streets. Jim loves to look for the human angle of every story, and he often interviews the families of gang members as well as their victims. In doing so, he gathers a lot of information, some of it off the record. If there's a problem Jim can't deal with in print, he'll call in a friendly hero to help him out. That is, of course, if that hero is willing to give him exclusive rights to the story."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1846637571" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Politics and terror shouldn't be mixed.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P351161171" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I can really use your help.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2194434755" "I'm sorry, but there's no news here. Try {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1567984665" "I need you to remind some of the villains in this city that might is for right, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3082451536" "I don't have a single story for you, {HeroName}. Ask your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1524859228" "I like to keep busy, too, {HeroName}. Just try not to overdo it."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3806841104" "I've been following a hot story. But maybe you should get to Security Level {Level} before I let you in on the scoop."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2235822395" "I like your style so far, my friend. My sources have provided me with some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you might enjoy. My phone is always on, so call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2579163374" "You are a hero deserving of my highest level of respect. I've got a few new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> I'd like you to look at."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P426681421" "Our stories are no longer the same, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1481549967" "Have you ever read any of Jim Bell's articles in the paper? He's a great reporter who's been doing a lot of articles on the Tsoo and the Warriors. Jim has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1833601023" "Choose Jim Bell"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P938540693" "Jim is outspoken and opinionated, but he is extremely well informed."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2765201165" "One of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>sources</A> wants to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3420727859" "There are some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>sources</A> I want you to meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


