// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Justin_Greene 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Justin Greene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1128054382" "Justin Greene"
// ProfessionString :
"P2930085092" "Community Watch Coordinator"
// DescriptionString :
"P1801641723" "Justin Greene is a retired hero who once fought evil under the name Green Justice. He lost his powers over a decade ago, but he never lost his commitment to keeping his community safe. These days he does that by coordinating the efforts of his local community watch. Justin works with current heroes and local residents to make sure that criminals never get a chance to set roots down. It's quite obvious that Justin still wishes he could put on a costume and fight evil directly, but, without his powers, he's only a match for common thugs and lesser criminals. The kinds of super-powered threats that menace the city are more than he can handle on his own. Fortunately, he's got more than a few friends willing to help him out. "
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2935142665" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I wish I could join you on this one, {HeroName}.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3034396238" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There are definitely some heads that need to be cracked together.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P226091997" "I'm sorry, but I'm in the middle of something too important to ignore right now. Maybe {LastContactName} has time to talk."
// FirstVisitString :
"P75385292" "Welcome, {HeroName}, I am looking forward to working with you. I haven't hit the streets myself in quite some time, but I still have excellent sources of information."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4182903991" "You're out of my league, {HeroName}. You should help someone with bigger worries than mine."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1657055976" "You need to learn to manage your workload better. Never take on too much."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P25847644" "I think you're almost ready for some of my toughest missions. Get to Security Level {Level}, and we'll be in business."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4134951960" "I think you might just have what it takes to become one of the greats, my friend. Let me provide you with some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>old equipment.</A> Use it well. I hope you'll call frequently and let me know how life is treating you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4056668405" "You are definitely going to become a household name in Paragon City, {HeroName}. You'll fare better if you take on some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>old gear.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3524950666" "I am small potatoes for you now, {HeroName}. Good luck with everything."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1921881245" "My friend Justin Greene has asked to see you. He's a coordinator for his local community watch group. He used to be a hero, so he knows how to help you clean up groups like the Sky Raiders and the Council. Justin has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2315403107" "Choose Justin Greene"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P53298849" "I think Justin will like you a great deal, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2110145857" "Time for you to meet one of my other <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>comrades</A> in the fight against crime in Paragon City."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P351075662" "You need to expand your list of contacts, {HeroName}. I have a couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>possibilities</A> in mind."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


