// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Justine_Kelly 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Justine Kelly 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3307799783" "Justine Kelly"
// ProfessionString :
"P449738606" "Software Analyst"
// DescriptionString :
"P3601453741" "Justine Kelly calls herself a software analyst, though most people simply call her a hacker. Justine knows computers like the back of her hand, and she knows they can be valuable tool in fighting crime. In the world of computer crime, she's kind of a hero herself, and more than a few have theorized that she has some subtle super power related to computers. She handles the malicious hackers, software thieves, and other online miscreants herself, but more and more her computer problems have real world implications. That's when she calls in the big guns: any one of a number of heroes she has befriended over the years. She's always eager to pass on a tip or help out a hero. After all, in her own way, she's just like them."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3018049940" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Well, if it isn't my favorite hero. There's some bad mojo afoot.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3309679530" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is a lot of crime that needs addressing.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3376747017" "Can't talk. Coding. Jack in to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2293297891" "I am really glad to see you. You know why? You've got the body and I've got the brain."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1745363574" "You should help somebody else, {HeroName}. I haven't run across anything I can't handle."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2205130091" "Looks like you've got too much to do as it is."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3295926518" "I'd like to see you get to Security Level {Level}. Then I'll know you can handle my next assignment."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3212458543" "You do your thing as well as I do mine, friend. I've got some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>far-out Enhancements</A> I'd like you to see. Take my number. I want you to call me up if there's anything I can do for you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1107029821" "You are as l33t as they come in the hero world. If you have the cash, I have all the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you'll need."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4286705117" "Time to conquer new horizons, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3840682434" "If you ever have a computer problem or want a lead on some computer related crime, you should talk to Justine Kelly. She's a whiz at technical stuff and a bit of an online hero in her own right. Lately she has been focusing her attention on the Sky Raiders and the Lost. Justine has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P518000989" "Choose Justine Kelly"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P86453041" "Justine is a very skilled young lady."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3002670114" "Check it, I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> you should talk to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1449087115" "I know some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>peeps</A> you should meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


