// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Kirsten_Woods 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Kirsten Woods 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3506049924" "Kirsten Woods"
// ProfessionString :
"P3047598449" "CIA Operative"
// DescriptionString :
"P1205854273" "The CIA is strictly forbidden from operating on American soil, but they can and do keep an eye on things. International threats, like the Sky Raiders, arouse their greatest concerns. Kirsten Woods is an intelligence officer who has the rather complicated job of trying to figure out how to best use CIA resources to combat such threats without stepping on the FBI's toes. Luckily for her, there are heroes: powerful, freelance operatives who are free to work in the United States. Kirsten works closely with many heroes, offering them intelligence on criminal activities and sometimes even asking them to carry out operations. She walks a tightrope of legal technicalities, but she also gets the job done."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P918169624" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I might have some information you might be interested in.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1282823415" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let me bring some things to your attention.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2102588591" "I have nothing to discuss with you at this time. I believe {LastContactName} has some missions that are not classified."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3971651834" "I am looking forward to having many productive discussions with you, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3640557501" "My cases are too easy for you, {HeroName}. You should go help out where you're needed most."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1918351661" "Looks like your in box is as crowded as mine."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3959678700" "The agency has marked my next case top secret. Get to Security Level {Level}, and maybe we can crack it together."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P231157160" "A little trust has to go a long way in my business, friend. I hope I can trust you with the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest tech</A> from the agency. Just don't let it slip into the wrong hands. If you need to call, use my private line."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1149955264" "I haven't trusted many people as much as I trust you, {HeroName}. Here, I want you to see all my top secret <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A> Just don't tell anyone where you got them."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4293025842" "You should try speaking to someone else from now on, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1847000118" "I've been asked to keep this very quiet, but someone from the CIA wants to meet you. Her name is Kirsten Woods and she knows quite a bit about the Sky Raiders. She also thinks there may be more to the Lost than meets the eye. As a CIA operative, Agent Woods has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3394171560" "Choose Kirsten Woods"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3401779000" "Keep a low profile when you are working with Kirsten."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3441956694" "I have arranged for you to meet <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone.</A>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3315015715" "There are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> who you need to meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


