// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Manuel_Ruiz 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Lt. Manuel Ruiz 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4193724864" "Lt. Manuel Ruiz"
// ProfessionString :
"P142933958" "Police Officer, Gang Unit"
// DescriptionString :
"P4200891672" "Gangs continue to be a problem in Paragon City, and it's Manuel Ruiz's job to deal with them. A highly decorated and dedicated officer, Lt. Ruiz made a name for himself when he went undercover for a year within the now defunct Brothers of Doom gang. The gang of super-powered thugs had menaced the city throughout the 1980's, but, thanks to Ruiz's bravery, they were brought down. Today, Lt. Ruiz manages other undercover officers. He also works with the city's heroes, since he realizes that costume-clad defenders are often the only thing standing between the city and utter chaos. While heroes seldom go undercover themselves, they can give his officers valuable support."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2759308276" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Some things never change in this city. We got a problem, {HeroName}.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2212326708" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Another day, another gang. Ready to make a difference?</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3850851150" "I'm sorry, I just don't have time right now. But I know {LastContactName} needs some assistance."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3149734733" "The gangs in this city are growing faster than the police force can keep up with. Hopefully, that's where you come in."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1400201262" "The force has things covered on this end. Check with your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2913231510" "Take my advice, and go to work on some of your old cases."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P909050820" "I have a job for you, but I'd like to see you reach Security Level {Level} first."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P878860669" "You keep impressing me, friend, and we'll get along fine. The unit just requisitioned some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new gear.</A> Guess I could let you take first pick. If there's something you need, you can call me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1172079724" "You've got what it takes as far as I'm concerned, {HeroName}. Things are getting serious, and you're going to need <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>better Enhancements.</A> Let me fit you out."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2836720515" "I'll hold down this neighborhood, my friend. You get out there and cover the rest of the city."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2634311339" "I'd like you to meet Lt. Manuel Ruiz from the Gang Unit. He specializes in running undercover operations, and he's always looking for trustworthy individuals to help him out with the Tsoo and the Warriors. The department supplies Lt. Ruiz with Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2795962954" "Choose Lt. Ruiz"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P13503774" "Lt. Ruiz has put a lot of gangers away himself; he can help you do the same."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3063780687" "One of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>informants</A> wants to deal with you directly."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3646348520" "I have a couple new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>informants</A> in mind for you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


