// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Melanie Peebles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P628007394" "Melanie Peebles"
// ProfessionString :
"P2366182719" "Dream Analyst"
// DescriptionString :
"P4062896344" "Melanie Peebles is an ultra-lucid dreamer. She not only controls her dreams, she can actually enter the dream world at will to seek out information. For years she lived in a dream state and had very little interaction with other people. Then, during the Rikti War, she was disturbed by recurring dreams of the alien invaders. This gave her the impetus to start using her abilities to help the city fight back. Ever since, she has helped heroes by providing them information from her dreams. She has become quite adept at using her abilities and has even begun to get some recognition in the press, something she's less than pleased about."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P613169548" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>My dreams grow darker, {HeroName}. Help me brighten them.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1825314646" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Can you prevent my latest dream from coming to fruition?</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1072835387" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let us turn nightmares into dreams.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3067259369" "I'm sorry, I can't talk to you. I believe your destiny is linked to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1717416752" "I dreamed I would meet you some day, {HeroName}. And look, here you are."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1969872843" "My dreams have been untroubled of late. Perhaps someone else has some nightmares for you to deal with."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3845754665" "You shouldn't take on so much work, {HeroName}. After all, you have to get your rest."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3936552664" "I don't want to send you into anything you're not ready for. Why not get to Security Level {Level} before we discuss your next case?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1950417278" "Working with you has been even better than I dreamed, my friend. I hope you can find all the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you need in my store. Here is my number, {HeroName}. Please stay in touch."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2051470109" "I am glad I have someone I can trust during the time of my darkest dreams. The <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>potent draughts</A> in my store should protect you against your very worst nightmares."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2373890134" "I know it's time for you to go elsewhere. You can trust me on that."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2555829918" "Melanie Peebles has the power to see things through her dreams. Her most recent dreams have been about the Sky Raiders and the Lost. Melanie has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P600087676" "Choose Melanie Peebles"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P208141929" "Do not dismiss Melanie's guidance lightly."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3474651290" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P182536558" "I know that these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> would like to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


