// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Oliver_Haak 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Oliver Haak 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2424685740" "Oliver Haak"
// ProfessionString :
"P2731680986" "Occultist"
// DescriptionString :
"P2399344214" "Oliver Haak styles himself an occultist, and he's a bit of a mystery to the heroes he works with. Some say he possesses magical abilities, while others believe his only power is a vast knowledge of magical lore. He seems to have some intuitive grasp of mystical matters, yet he never seems to spend any time studying ancient books or delving through forgotten libraries. There are those who speculate that Oliver is actually a helpful spirit in human guise. Others maintain that he's channeling the spirits of the world's greatest wise men. The one thing that everyone agrees upon is that he's very happy to share his knowledge with heroes he deems worthy of his attention."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2085829363" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There are new mysteries for me to introduce you to.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3096270179" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Are you prepared for the fight against evil?</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3159496757" "You are not yet ready to learn that which I know. {LastContactName} can assist you in your journey."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2945779151" "You come seeking knowledge? Excellent, you've come to the right place."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3915518444" "Sorry, {HeroName}, I have nothing that would interest you. Try asking another contact."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1108654206" "I see you already have a full workload."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1577047121" "I think you should work toward Security Level {Level}, {HeroName}. I've got a task that requires a fine touch."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P591361390" "I must admit, my friend, you have impressed me. That is a rare occurrence. Allow me to show you some of the more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>powerful talismans</A> in my store. If you need me, all you have to do is call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2655604351" "You have proven yourself worthy in more ways than you know. My deepest <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>mystical secrets</A> are yours to peruse."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2961741601" "I am no longer the one to advise you."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3494322878" "If you can gain his confidence, Oliver Haak is a rich source of information on the occult. Don't be put off by his demeanor, {HeroName}, I know that you will impress him. He can really help you out against the Banished Pantheon and the Circle of Thorns. Oliver has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3431540692" "Choose Oliver Haak"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P179263659" "Your actions will speak for you with Oliver."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P51656771" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> else who can help you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P433202298" "You have shown me that it is time to introduce you to some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>colleagues.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


