// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Oswald Cuthbert 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P504136895" "Oswald Cuthbert"
// ProfessionString :
"P1554543760" "Probation Officer"
// DescriptionString :
"P773835409" "Being a probation officer in Paragon City has its own unique challenges. Criminals with super powers, gangs with dreams of world domination, and magical devices can give any law enforcement officer nightmares. Still, Oswald Cuthbert does his best to deal with it calmly and professionally. He's a 20-year veteran of the job, and in his time he's seen everything. He's particularly interested in some of the unique military groups that plague Paragon City, like the Sky Raiders and the Council. He makes it his business to know everything he can about them so that he can do his job better. Oswald likes to work with heroes, and he often gives them a chance to find parole violators before he goes out in the field himself."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1100432966" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I got trouble that needs lookin' into.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2995575616" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Got some jobs for ya, {HeroName}.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3644429959" "Not now, ok? Go see {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P735216826" "Things look a little different from down here. I hope you don't mind getting your hands dirty."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1634563069" "My jobs aren't tough enough for you, {HeroName}. You should be helping someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1374762478" "Trust me, {HeroName}, you don't want to take on any more work. You're swamped as it is."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1767660835" "Some of my customers are real tough characters. I'd like to see you get to Security Level {Level} before I give you another job."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3757614562" "Hmm, not bad, {HeroName}. This could be the beginning of a beautiful friendship. I confiscated some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>interesting Enhancements</A> from a parolee yesterday. You need anything, you call me. Understood?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2775628938" "I like you, {HeroName}. You got my respect. If there's any <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> you need, just let me know."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3207079350" "Nothing for you to see here."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1348844565" "I'd like you to meet Oswald Cuthbert. He's a probation officer and thus has a lot of contact with the sordid side of Paragon City. He often uses heroes like you to help him out with the Sky Raiders and the Council. Oswald can get you Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P908448528" "Choose Oswald Cuthbert"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1664559162" "Good choice, {HeroName}, and good hunting."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2269323095" "I got <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> who wants to meetcha."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2493659710" "You ready to meet a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>couple</A> more people?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


