// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Piper Irving 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P670928874" "Piper Irving"
// ProfessionString :
"P1941374283" "Anthropologist"
// DescriptionString :
"P1867721167" "Piper Irving recently graduated from Paragon University with a PhD in Anthropology. Unlike many of her classmates, she decided to stay in the city to continue her research. Her particular area of focus is the city's religion-based criminal organizations. After a few near-death experiences, she has learned that it's much better to work with heroes than on her own. She is often consulted because of her expertise on the belief systems and practices of groups like the Banished Pantheon and the Circle of Thorns. She's very enthusiastic about her work and is always looking for new help with her research."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1551346912" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got some difficulties I want your help with.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3889980840" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Glad you are ready to lend a hand, {HeroName}.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1061010630" "Oh, I am so sorry, but I can't talk now. Go see {LastContactName}. Ciao!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2917853912" "I don't like leaving the field work to others, but I have heard good things about you, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1887695979" "I don't have a job for you, unless you're interested in typing up my bibliography. No? Well, ask one of your other contacts then."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1391493598" "Pulling an all-nighter, {HeroName}? You've got a lot of assignments!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1205985011" "I've stumbled across something big. If you reach Security Level {Level}, I'll share it with you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2291031448" "You are good at this, {HeroName}. I hope we'll always be friends. I think some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> might help you in your adventures. Take my number, {HeroName}. You never know when you might need it."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P937763423" "I am a student of human nature, {HeroName}, and you have truly impressed me. Check out my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest Enhancements</A>; they are sure to impress you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2812658011" "You should try and dig up information elsewhere."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P76817514" "I'd like you to go see my friend Piper Irving. She's an anthropologist working here in the city. She knows a ton about the obscure beliefs of the Banished Pantheon and the Circle of Thorns. Piper knows where to get Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1815747057" "Choose Piper Irving"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4272619104" "I am sure you will find Piper quite knowledgeable."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2226787193" "A <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>colleague</A> of mine wants to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3725277663" "I want you to meet some of my other <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>colleagues.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


