// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Polly_Cooper 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Polly Cooper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2318877533" "Polly Cooper"
// ProfessionString :
"P1292528247" "Civil Air Patrol Coordinator"
// DescriptionString :
"P817819039" "Once the Civil Air Patrol helped defend America's skies by watching the clouds for enemy aircraft. Modern radar and high flying jets ended that role, but the rise of the flying super-powered criminal has brought it back with a vengeance. The Paragon City Civil Air Patrol consists of a few full time employees like Polly Cooper and a host of volunteers throughout the metropolitan area. They take turns watching the skies for flying robots, villains, strange aircraft, alien attack pods, demonic winged creatures, and all other threats. Polly Cooper's job is to coordinate those reports and pass them on to the appropriate authorities. As often as not, that means freelance heroes who have the time and expertise to handle such threats. Polly's network of watchers and volunteers makes her an invaluable resource for any hero who wants to keep the skies safe for birds and heroes alike."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3753125484" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We have a full agenda, {HeroName}.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3063690774" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We have our work cut out for us.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3806118550" "I have no time to waste chatting with you. Maybe {LastContactName} can spare a minute."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4036446772" "The threat to Paragon City is increasing daily. I hope together we can make a dent in that unfortunate state of affairs."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P747263609" "The skies are crystal clear. Maybe someone else needs your assistance."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4030435743" "You've got a lot of jobs already, {HeroName}. I don't think you should take on any more."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P287839416" "I'd like your help, but I think it's best if you get to Security Level {Level} first."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P74703835" "So far I have to admit I am impressed by your efforts, my friend. I'd like you to have some of my more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>interesting Enhancements.</A> And, {HeroName}, don't hesitate to call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1004688441" "At this time, you have earned my full confidence, {HeroName}. You should take a look at all my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>best Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2134555910" "Our work together is complete. Mission accomplished."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3771703299" "I'd love for you to meet Polly Cooper. She's a coordinator for the Civil Air Patrol, and she knows a lot about the Sky Raiders and the Lost. Polly has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P965932306" "Choose Polly Cooper"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P958741817" "Miss Cooper is very skilled at her job and should prove to be a valuable asset to you."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3711123174" "I have a new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> for you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1589693383" "I have two new contact <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>possibilities</A> for you to meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


