// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Rondel Jackson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1684183691" "Rondel Jackson"
// ProfessionString :
"P2630635893" "Detective"
// DescriptionString :
"P2826165507" "While every cop faces extraordinary challenges in a place like Paragon City, Detective Rondel Jackson has an especially dangerous job. He's part of the Organized Crimes Task Force, a group of police dedicated to stopping crimes committed by highly-organized groups with military roots, like the Sky Raiders and the Council. Unlike many members of the unit, Rondel has no formal training in military practices or theories. He's just a cop, doing what he does best: enforcing the law. To get the job done, he's learned to rely on a number of helpful heroes."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2807956810" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I got word on some trouble brewing.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1405779963" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>My sources in the department handed over some good info.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3682842294" "You got the wrong guy. Go bother {LastContactName}, ok?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P652388028" "Welcome to the Organized Crimes Task Force. I hope we can work well together."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1554036311" "These cases are nothing I can't handle. You should be helping someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3557172067" "I recommend you clear house on all those old cases."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2973582720" "Sorry, {HeroName}, this case is classified. Maybe if you get to Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4192352170" "Glad to be on the same team, friend. The department just got some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new equipment</A> I think you could use. You run into a jam, call me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2387529855" "You have put in good time with me, {HeroName}. You have my full trust. Please take a look at some of the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> in my store. You'll need them against the Sky Raiders."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4124317818" "You've outgrown my little task force, {HeroName}. Good luck!"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4094844483" "Detective Rondel Jackson is a great guy to talk to if you want the police perspective on groups like the Sky Raiders and the Council. He's also the one to talk to if you need Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1251181642" "Choose Rondel Jackson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2821274483" "Detective Jackson is a hardworking straight-shooter. He won't steer you wrong."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1112284368" "I have another <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> I want to introduce you to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2876062120" "A couple of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>informants</A> want to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


