// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Vic_Garland 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Vic Garland 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P45381733" "Vic Garland"
// ProfessionString :
"P230053736" "Civil Rights Activist"
// DescriptionString :
"P1597988298" "Civil rights can be a touchy subject for super-powered heroes. Equal opportunity is a cause they can all get behind, but when it comes to subjects like wrongful imprisonment and unfair prosecution, heroes tend to get nervous. It's Vic Garland's job to make them nervous. Vic has devoted his life to protecting the civil rights of every man, woman, and child in America. Sometimes that means suing a hero for wrongfully beating the snot out of a suspected criminal. But much more often it means helping a hero catch some criminal who's flagrantly violating the rights of ordinary citizens. Recently, Vic has developed another, more personal crusade. More and more villains have taken to hiding their hateful ideology and criminal activities behind a veneer of protest for civil rights. No group is guiltier of this than the Freakshow. Vic has a heated vendetta against such villains and, with the support of many heroes behind him, he's out to expose their nefarious activities."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P566684198" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is a lot going on.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P243386857" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's make a difference.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1481750417" "I'm sorry, but I just don't have time right now. Why not check with {LastContactName}?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1875678824" "If you can stick to the right side of the law, I will be the best ally you have ever had."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2113891875" "I don't have a single case for you, {HeroName}. Ask someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2721851034" "You've got quite a backlog of cases already."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2705721012" "This next case is kind of touchy. I'll give you a shot at it, but not until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P601702434" "My friend, I think we are going to get along just fine. If you're going to fight for the people's rights, you'll need <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>better Enhancements.</A> Let me help you out. {HeroName}, you should call me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P815898174" "At this point, you get my full support and trust. I recently got my hands on some powerful <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements.</A> Want to see?"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P335392989" "There are plenty of rights being violated elsewhere. I am counting on you to go out there and fight for them."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1555962223" "I think you should talk to Vic Garland. He's a civil rights activist who's doing some important work against the Freakshow. He's also more than a little curious about the Family. He could really use your help. Vic has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P782462076" "Choose Vic Garland"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2912787692" "Vic is uncompromising and fiercely loyal."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P914960610" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> who would very much like to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3975321454" "There are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> I want you to help."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


