// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Wilma Peterson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2196798768" "Wilma Peterson"
// ProfessionString :
"P2798891608" "Hazardous Waste Disposal Expert"
// DescriptionString :
"P4156418820" "With aliens, super-powered villains, and magical monsters roaming Paragon City's streets and burrowing beneath its ground, it's no wonder that all manner of unusual detritus ends up cast about the city. It's the job of people like Wilma Peterson to make sure it's all disposed of safely. She coordinates waste disposal teams in their efforts to recover materials the might prove dangerous in the wrong hands. These include everything from leftover Rikti technology to the mutagenic fluids left behind when a Devouring Earth creature is destroyed. Wilma often works hand in hand with heroes to help her clean up more dangerous locales, and she likes to pass on any information she discovers in the course of a day's work. Wilma's proud of her work, which is important to the city's environment, and she doesn't take kindly to being teased about being a garbage woman."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2799300198" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I need your help with some spring cleaning.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1448566487" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Some ambulatory waste needs to be dealt with.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P841684998" "Just got a major clean-up call. I gotta run. You want someone to help, you go see {LastContactName}, all right?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1688776431" "We both have jobs to do. Let's stick to business and keep the wisecracks out of it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P228927367" "You sure cleaned up things around here, {HeroName}. If you want work, you'll have to ask one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1593171019" "You're too busy to trust with new assignments."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2700828030" "Let's talk again when you reach Security Level {Level}. I think I'll have a job for you then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2110564933" "I think we're seeing eye to eye, my friend. I'd like to outfit you with all the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you'll need. If you run into a mess you can't deal with, please call on me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P918939690" "You have the right attitude to stay in my best graces, {HeroName}. I have some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>far-out junk</A> in my store, if you want to take a look."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1876204822" "There's bigger piles of trash out there for you to deal with now, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1661260339" "Have you ever heard of Wilma Patterson from the Department of Waste Management? She's one of the folks in charge of disposing of hazardous waste, like Rikti technology. You should stop by and see her sometime; she's got her eye on the Freakshow and the Family right now. Wilma has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P382106793" "Choose Wilma Peterson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3526562827" "Treat Wilma with respect and you will have a solid contact."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4051578910" "I have <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> for you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1084113905" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> I know can definitely use your help."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


