// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Wilson Eziquerra 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1639901273" "Wilson Eziquerra"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1095583781" "Most reporters with a beat like Wilson Eziquerra's would be eagerly angling for a transfer to the society page, but Wil actually enjoys reporting on Paragon City's many militant groups. He loves roaming the city's most dangerous neighborhoods looking for a scoop, and when he finds something to print, he never worries about retaliation. This cavalier attitude has gotten him into hot water again and again, and Wil's publisher's have had to call on heroes to rescue him from certain death no fewer than seven times. Still, Wil wouldn't trade his job for any other. He counts himself lucky to have a hand in exposing the nefarious activities of the Sky Raiders and the Council, and If he learns of a problem an article won't fix, he knows several heroes he can count on."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2847687539" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Heya, friend, have I got a story for you!</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2446113546" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You aren't gonna believe some of the stuff going on around here!</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2087469495" "I'm workin' on a big story here, no time to talk. Check with {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P199280156" "I think together you and I can find the rock these Sky Raiders are crawling out from under."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3245549591" "My beat's a cake walk lately, thanks to you. If you need some action, see one of your other pals."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3368784469" "Do what I do, {HeroName}. Start at the top, and don't stop working until your desk is clear."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2789357375" "It's dangerous on my beat, {HeroName}. I'd like to see you reach Security Level {Level} before you take on another of my leads."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P707159788" "I really appreciate the help you have given me, friend. Most people don't take me seriously. I think a number of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> might serve you well. If you need anything, my cell phone is always on."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1507350322" "Tell you what, {HeroName}, you can call me Wil. All my closest confidants do. I've got some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> for you, if you're interested."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1384258190" "You got bigger fish to fry."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1828751782" "Wil Eziquerra is an excellent reporter who specializes in stories on the Sky Raiders and the Council. His sources usually keep him stocked up with Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1001113949" "Choose Wil Eziquerra"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P408927753" "Wil is going to be a great resource for you, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2722347039" "Got <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> for you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P20396233" "Hey, I found a couple new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>sources</A> for you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

